Nicotine dependence is a state where you need nicotine to function normally, and you cannot stop using it. Nicotine is a chemical compound that naturally occurs in some plants, including tobacco. Its use is associated with pleasing effects on the brain, and therefore nicotine it's often used as a stimulant.

Cigarettes contain tobacco and are highly addictive due to their nicotine content. Cigarette smoking is associated with many health problems, including lung cancer, chronic obstructive pulmonary disease, and heart disease. It doesn't matter how long you have smoking for – quitting smoking can improve your health. It may not be easy, but it is possible to stop the dependence on nicotine.

