- Sardines.

🥬 Leafy greens – Packed with magnesium & vitamin K and present in these veggies:

- Spinach;

- Cabbage;

- Broccoli; and

- Kale.

🍊 Vitamin C-rich fruits – get yourself a smoothie with:

- Oranges;

