We all have many things to worry about now, so why worry about our looks and weight? This tool was created to give you some guidance and should help you identify critical points in the quarantine weight gain struggle. Knowing is half the battle.

Below you will find the 5 most important things you should keep in mind:

- Be aware that (most likely) you need less energy now — even if you're going to eat exactly the same things as before, you can still put on weight;

